Act as a senior Minecraft Paper plugin developer, Java architect, gameplay systems designer, database engineer, and software QA specialist.

Your task is to perform a complete technical and gameplay audit of my existing Minecraft plugin, **CytricosRaces**, and transform it into a polished, reliable, feature-rich RPG race system.

This is NOT a request to create a new plugin from scratch.

You must inspect the existing source code, understand its architecture, identify incomplete implementations and bugs, preserve working functionality, and implement the missing mechanics properly.

